From 73729a8ae656d1259f366134c5e9e46da081a377 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hibreak <build@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:30:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fonts: Noto Sans 450 instead of Google Sans Flex on e-ink
 (not the clock)

Settings and SystemUI families (google-sans*, variable-*) use Noto Sans on
the e-ink 450 weight curve; the lock-screen clock families keep Google
Sans Flex. Generated by scripts/dev/eink-fonts.py (docs/lessons-learned.md).

Change-Id: Icca81d69c3277ed248f6bef08742eb9847e8397d
---
